WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
You might think of those projects that those people as kind of like slightly disreputable or kind of

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
not to be trusted, or you know kind of like chances, basically, because that's what they are

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:43.000
But

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Heads I win, tails you lose. If the people who kick projects off

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Realize that they can adopt a strategy where if the project is successful, they can be around and take the credit for it and kind of get value out of the project.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
And if the project isn't successful, there can be nowhere near it and claim to not have any knowledge of it

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
And

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Basically say, oh, it's nothing to do with me. I don't know how that project happened.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Then if they can adopt that strategy and they realize they can adopt that strategy

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Then

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.000
They're much more tempted to kick off more projects.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:33.000
And again, this sounds like kind of quite a disreputable thing.

